#!RuleTest
#test PMDA-AD0275 expect=skipped domain=ADAE
#note "DOSECUMU is not declared on the dataset. Requirements.Variables.All gates the rule on the presence of the pair, so with the unit half absent the rule never executes - asserted as skipped, not borrowed as noViolation. The two rows carry a populated DOSECUM, i.e. data that would fire if the rule ran."
#library standard=adamig version=1-0
dataset ADAE
col STUDYID type=Char
col USUBJID type=Char
col AEDECOD type=Char
col DOSECUM type=Num
---
CDISCPILOT01 | 01-701-1015 | HEADACHE | 350
CDISCPILOT01 | 01-701-1023 | NAUSEA   | 700
